   "text": "No polling queries, no mark UPDATE, commit order, low latency.\nCosts: more moving parts, and an inactive replication slot\nretains WAL until the disk fills.",
   "originalText": "No polling queries, no mark UPDATE, commit order, low latency.\nCosts: more moving parts, and an inactive replication slot\nretains WAL until the disk fills.",
