   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "One line: Polling asks the table \"anything new?\" in a loop; CDC listens to the database's own commit log. Rule: START with polling, keep the relay\nbehind a clean interface, move to CDC when throughput, latency or operational maturity demand it.",
   "originalText": "One line: Polling asks the table \"anything new?\" in a loop; CDC listens to the database's own commit log. Rule: START with polling, keep the relay\nbehind a clean interface, move to CDC when throughput, latency or operational maturity demand it.",
