   "seed": 1202978091,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1575402000,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1795651200000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "- Ordering across workers: A holds rows 1-500, B takes 501-1000 and may publish\n   first\n- Exactly-once processing\n- A consistent view of the queue (the Postgres docs call this an inconsistent\n   view by design)\nFine for a job queue, DANGEROUS for per-aggregate order.\nLocks also block anyone else's mark UPDATE / DELETE on those rows\n(intended).",
   "originalText": "- Ordering across workers: A holds rows 1-500, B takes 501-1000 and may publish\n   first\n- Exactly-once processing\n- A consistent view of the queue (the Postgres docs call this an inconsistent\n   view by design)\nFine for a job queue, DANGEROUS for per-aggregate order.\nLocks also block anyone else's mark UPDATE / DELETE on those rows\n(intended).",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "tex-00338",
