   "text": "Writer or trigger can nudge the relay right\nafter a commit. A latency HINT only:\nnotifications are not durable, polling stays\nthe source of truth.",
   "originalText": "Writer or trigger can nudge the relay right\nafter a commit. A latency HINT only:\nnotifications are not durable, polling stays\nthe source of truth.",
