   "text": "ONE long transaction: a DB connection and row locks are held for the whole Kafka round trip. A Kafka stall = held connection + long transaction (blocks vacuum).",
   "originalText": "ONE long transaction: a DB connection and row locks are held for the whole Kafka round trip. A Kafka stall = held connection + long transaction (blocks vacuum).",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "rec-00428",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
