   "locked": false,
   "text": "Result of a re-claim: a second worker sends the same rows = a duplicate (acceptable, but visible). Costs: more states and more writes (claim + mark).",
   "originalText": "Result of a re-claim: a second worker sends the same rows = a duplicate (acceptable, but visible). Costs: more states and more writes (claim + mark).",
