   "updated": 1795651200000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "So a stalled broker cannot hold the DB connection for minutes. Move to\nclaim-with-lease only if profiling shows the long transaction is really a problem.",
   "originalText": "So a stalled broker cannot hold the DB connection for minutes. Move to\nclaim-with-lease only if profiling shows the long transaction is really a problem.",
