   "text": "The message key only keeps one partition per aggregate. Kafka stores records in ARRIVAL order, so if two relays race, the key cannot repair the order.",
   "originalText": "The message key only keeps one partition per aggregate. Kafka stores records in ARRIVAL order, so if two relays race, the key cannot repair the order.",
