   "text": "Leader election: pg_try_advisory_lock, a Kubernetes lease, or simply run one\nreplica.\nHA by fast restart or a standby that takes the lock.\nSimplest. Throughput capped at one process.",
   "originalText": "Leader election: pg_try_advisory_lock, a Kubernetes lease, or simply run one\nreplica.\nHA by fast restart or a standby that takes the lock.\nSimplest. Throughput capped at one process.",
