   "text": "Same aggregate always goes to the same relay, so per-aggregate order is kept;\nparallelism = N.\nNeeds a stable assignment and a rebalancing story when N changes.\n(Relay contents shown are illustrative.)",
   "originalText": "Same aggregate always goes to the same relay, so per-aggregate order is kept;\nparallelism = N.\nNeeds a stable assignment and a rebalancing story when N changes.\n(Relay contents shown are illustrative.)",
