   "text": "Many relays; consumers drop events with version <= applied.\nWorks when consumers keep only the latest state (cache, config). NOT for\nappend-only histories.",
   "originalText": "Many relays; consumers drop events with version <= applied.\nWorks when consumers keep only the latest state (cache, config). NOT for\nappend-only histories.",
