   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The hashtext modulus filter cannot use the partial index. For large N and big\nbacklogs store a shard smallint column computed at insert time, and index (shard, id)\nWHERE published_at IS NULL.",
   "originalText": "The hashtext modulus filter cannot use the partial index. For large N and big\nbacklogs store a shard smallint column computed at insert time, and index (shard, id)\nWHERE published_at IS NULL.",
