   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Retries with one relay keep order: after a partial batch failure the WHOLE transaction rolls back, so the batch is retried in the same order. Per-key order holds;\nduplicates appear.",
   "originalText": "Retries with one relay keep order: after a partial batch failure the WHOLE transaction rolls back, so the batch is retried in the same order. Per-key order holds;\nduplicates appear.",
