   "text": "Longer transaction.\nBigger duplicate window: a crash replays up to ONE whole batch.\nMore data held in memory.",
   "originalText": "Longer transaction.\nBigger duplicate window: a crash replays up to ONE whole batch.\nMore data held in memory.",
