   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Ballpark [reasoning, not measured]: low thousands of rows/s per relay on a modest primary. The limit is usually Postgres write amplification and send round trips,\nnot the SELECT.",
   "originalText": "Ballpark [reasoning, not measured]: low thousands of rows/s per relay on a modest primary. The limit is usually Postgres write amplification and send round trips,\nnot the SELECT.",
