   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Symptom: the poll query gets slower over time while the live backlog is small. Cure: vacuum keeps up, and transactions stay short (long ones stop vacuum\nfrom removing dead tuples).",
   "originalText": "Symptom: the poll query gets slower over time while the live backlog is small. Cure: vacuum keeps up, and transactions stay short (long ones stop vacuum\nfrom removing dead tuples).",
