   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Progress is tracked twice: as Connect SOURCE OFFSETS and as the slot's CONFIRMED LSN. Only after the acknowledgement can Postgres\nrecycle that WAL.",
   "originalText": "Progress is tracked twice: as Connect SOURCE OFFSETS and as the slot's CONFIRMED LSN. Only after the acknowledgement can Postgres\nrecycle that WAL.",
