   "text": "The router acts on inserts; updates are ignored, deletes are dropped.\nThat is what allows deleting outbox rows afterwards.",
   "originalText": "The router acts on inserts; updates are ignored, deletes are dropped.\nThat is what allows deleting outbox rows afterwards.",
