   "updated": 1795651200000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Result: the table is always empty and never bloats, yet CDC loses nothing: it reads the log, not the table. Check your Debezium version's docs and TEST\nit; some setups prefer short retention + periodic batched delete so rows stay visible for debugging.",
   "originalText": "Result: the table is always empty and never bloats, yet CDC loses nothing: it reads the log, not the table. Check your Debezium version's docs and TEST\nit; some setups prefer short retention + periodic batched delete so rows stay visible for debugging.",
