   "text": "Aggregate id as key: one partition\nkeeps the order. Connect uses an\nidempotent / ordered producer setup\nfor source tasks; check\nproducer.override.* if you tune it.",
   "originalText": "Aggregate id as key: one partition\nkeeps the order. Connect uses an\nidempotent / ordered producer setup\nfor source tasks; check\nproducer.override.* if you tune it.",
