   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The WAL is one sequential stream, so\none slot = one task and bounded\nthroughput. Scale by publications /\nslots per table or a functional split,\nNOT by task count.",
   "originalText": "The WAL is one sequential stream, so\none slot = one task and bounded\nthroughput. Scale by publications /\nslots per table or a functional split,\nNOT by task count.",
