   "text": "BEGIN; SELECT .. WHERE published_at IS NULL ORDER BY id LIMIT n FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED;\nsend(acks=all); UPDATE / DELETE; COMMIT.     One relay (or key-sharded) for order.\nUse a flag or delete, never a bare id cursor.     Watch: oldest-unpublished age, bloat.",
   "originalText": "BEGIN; SELECT .. WHERE published_at IS NULL ORDER BY id LIMIT n FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED;\nsend(acks=all); UPDATE / DELETE; COMMIT.     One relay (or key-sharded) for order.\nUse a flag or delete, never a bare id cursor.     Watch: oldest-unpublished age, bloat.",
