   "text": "It is silently passed over and the next candidate is considered. NOWAIT errors at\nonce; the default waits for the lock holder.",
   "originalText": "It is silently passed over and the next candidate is considered. NOWAIT errors at\nonce; the default waits for the lock holder.",
