   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Next, note 4: the INBOX pattern. The consumer-side mirror: record processed message ids in the same transaction as the side effect, so\nthe duplicates these relays inevitably produce are harmless.",
   "originalText": "Next, note 4: the INBOX pattern. The consumer-side mirror: record processed message ids in the same transaction as the side effect, so\nthe duplicates these relays inevitably produce are harmless.",
